  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administration of Equity Investment for Smart Joules Private Limited</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The transaction involves the administration of an equity investment of up to the Indian rupee equivalent of $2,000,000 to be provided by the Asian Development Bank (ADB) Ventures Investment Fund 1 in Smart Joules Private Limited (SJPL) in India. Consistent with the establishment arrangements for the fund, ADB will not invest its own capital alongside the fund.</narrative>
  </description>
